 "$comment": "College calendar pattern (T3.2.1). Season Y = the season played in the fall of Y; its anchors run from January 1 of Y to the playoff final in January of Y+1. The playoff pattern follows the 2027 24-team shape. Recruiting periods are dated data only (T4.2.1): a year with no dated file has none, and the engine reports it.",
 "level": "college",
